1
00:00:02,461 --> 00:00:03,629
Hey, guys.

2
00:00:03,671 --> 00:00:05,213
Hey. Honey, I got
us that room

3
00:00:05,255 --> 00:00:06,966
at the Woodford
Inn this weekend.

4
00:00:07,007 --> 00:00:08,425
That place in Vermont?

5
00:00:08,467 --> 00:00:11,595
You can take a hint!

6
00:00:11,637 --> 00:00:13,012
Wait, you can't go
away this weekend.

7
00:00:13,054 --> 00:00:14,014
It's Emma's birthday.
Yeah.

8
00:00:14,055 --> 00:00:15,516
We're having a party.

9
00:00:15,557 --> 00:00:17,392
Well, can't you just
have the party when we get back?

10
00:00:17,434 --> 00:00:18,686
No.
No.

11
00:00:18,727 --> 00:00:20,562
Then it won't be
her real birthday.

12
00:00:20,604 --> 00:00:23,732
Gee, if only
she were one and had no idea

13
00:00:23,774 --> 00:00:26,025
