14
00:00:26,067 --> 00:00:28,821
Come on, you guys,
this is really important to us.

15
00:00:28,863 --> 00:00:30,447
Well, I'm sorry,

16
00:00:30,489 --> 00:00:31,991
but Chandler and I could
really use a weekend away,

17
00:00:32,031 --> 00:00:34,409
