to my little sister.

24
00:00:48,298 --> 00:00:50,509
RACHEL:
And I mean, you know,

25
00:00:50,551 --> 00:00:52,260
you guys, this
is a big deal.

26
00:00:52,302 --> 00:00:54,513
I mean, how can
we have her first
birthday party

27
00:00:54,555 --> 00:00:56,264
