and her uncle?

28
00:00:56,306 --> 00:00:58,433
All right, we'll stay.

29
00:00:58,475 --> 00:00:59,977
We can just drive up
after the party.

30
00:01:00,019 --> 00:01:01,854
Fine. But if
we end up

31
00:01:01,896 --> 00:01:03,939
