because of this party...

32
00:01:03,981 --> 00:01:06,650
Believe me, that is not
why we won't be doing that.

33
00:01:13,281 --> 00:01:18,119
♪ So no one told you
life was gonna be this way ♪

34
00:01:18,161 --> 00:01:20,831
♪ Your job's a joke,
you're broke ♪

35
00:01:20,873 --> 00:01:23,000
♪ Your love life's D.O.A. ♪

36
00:01:23,042 --> 00:01:26,962
♪ It's like you're always
stuck in second gear ♪

37
00:01:27,004 --> 00:01:30,507
♪ When it hasn't been
your day, your week ♪

38
00:01:30,549 --> 00:01:32,968
♪ Your month,
or even your year ♪

39
00:01:33,010 --> 00:01:36,680
♪ But I'll be there for you ♪

40
00:01:36,722 --> 00:01:42,477
♪ 'Cause you're there
for me, too. ♪

41
00:01:47,106 --> 00:01:48,984
You know, Pheebs,
when I was little,

42
00:01:49,026 --> 00:01:51,570
on my birthday,
my daddy would hide a present

43
00:01:51,612 --> 00:01:53,072
in every room of the house.

44
00:01:53,113 --> 00:01:54,907
And then he would draw
a treasure map

45
00:01:54,949 --> 00:01:56,324
to help me find them all.

46
00:01:56,366 --> 00:01:59,078
Oh. I love family
traditions like that.

47
00:01:59,119 --> 00:02:01,663
When, um... when Ursula
and I were kids,

48
00:02:01,705 --> 00:02:04,750
on our birthday,
our stepdad would
sell his blood

49
00:02:04,792 --> 00:02:07,294
to buy us food.

50
00:02:08,629 --> 00:02:10,005
Hey, you guys.

51
00:02:10,047 --> 00:02:11,465
Hi.
Hey.

52
00:02:11,506 --> 00:02:13,926
Hi. I brought the camera
for Emma's video.

53
00:02:13,968 --> 00:02:15,552
Oh, good, good.
We had this idea

54
00:02:15,594 --> 00:02:17,096
