195
00:07:44,172 --> 00:07:46,341
"And while he
rocked her, he sang

196
00:07:46,383 --> 00:07:48,343
"I'll love you forever.

197
00:07:48,385 --> 00:07:50,845
"I'll like you for always.

198
00:07:50,887 --> 00:07:56,517
As long as I'm living,
